DISCLAIMER:

This software is a research prototype designed for computational materials
science research and development. It is NOT:

- A medical diagnostic device
- A clinical prediction tool
- A thermal comfort scoring system
- A material certification platform
- A replacement for laboratory experiments

All simulations are computational estimates based on declared parameters and
mathematical models. Results must be validated against experimental data before
any practical application.

The software makes NO medical claims and provides NO physiological predictions.
Users are responsible for appropriate interpretation of results within the
documented limitations.

For research and educational purposes only.
